{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00714",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 2.61,
      "end_seconds": 12.93,
      "duration_seconds": 10.32,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'm Bridie, Callum's foster carer. He needs this medical form completed for the apprenticeship, and he's a bit nervous."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.05,
      "end_seconds": 20.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "I'm not nervous. I just don't like doctors. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.31,
      "end_seconds": 38.17,
      "duration_seconds": 14.86,
      "text": "Fair enough, Callum, I'll make it as painless as I can. It's a standard form, so I need to ask about your health. How are you generally? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.4,
      "end_seconds": 42.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Fine. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 45.58,
      "end_seconds": 50.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "He gets headaches, doctor. He doesn't tell people."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.57,
      "end_seconds": 56.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Callum, do you get headaches?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.33,
      "end_seconds": 63.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Sometimes. Not a big deal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.98,
      "end_seconds": 70.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "How long have you had them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.71,
      "end_seconds": 77.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Dunno. A while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 80.9,
      "end_seconds": 94.77,
      "duration_seconds": 13.87,
      "text": "I'm not sure either, I've only had him two years, and he had them when he came to me. I can't say when they began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.87,
      "end_seconds": 106.57,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll write that the start isn't known. Do you get anything with them, sickness, flashing lights?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.68,
      "end_seconds": 112.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "No. Just a headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.0,
      "end_seconds": 123.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "And do your knees or joints hurt, when you run or do sport?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.5,
      "end_seconds": 131.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "My left knee. When I play football. It clicks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.78,
      "end_seconds": 137.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Any chest pain or fainting, ever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.39,
      "end_seconds": 143.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "No. Never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.38,
      "end_seconds": 158.27,
      "duration_seconds": 11.89,
      "text": "Good. For the form, I'll fill in the rest from your school health records. Is that all right? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.59,
      "end_seconds": 163.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.25,
      "end_seconds": 172.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Your hearing and eye checks at school were fine, I see. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 175.82,
      "end_seconds": 183.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "He's had his jabs, they're all up to date. I've got the red book. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.66,
      "end_seconds": 190.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Thank you, Bridie. Callum, what's the apprenticeship in? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.13,
      "end_seconds": 195.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Joinery. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.4,
      "end_seconds": 213.19,
      "duration_seconds": 13.79,
      "text": "That's a good trade. You'll need to wear ear protection, and goggles, and not lift anything too heavy until you've been trained."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.52,
      "end_seconds": 218.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "I know. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.35,
      "end_seconds": 229.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "Your knee clicking, any pain on stairs, or does it give way? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.29,
      "end_seconds": 235.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "No. It just clicks. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.81,
      "end_seconds": 248.43,
      "duration_seconds": 9.62,
      "text": "That's common, and not usually a problem. If it starts to swell, lock, or give way, come and see me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.27,
      "end_seconds": 253.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.12,
      "end_seconds": 266.96,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "text": "On the headaches, keep a note of when they happen and what you were doing, in case it's tiredness or screens."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 270.06,
      "end_seconds": 273.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I'll help him with that. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.59,
      "end_seconds": 285.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.29,
      "text": "I'll complete the form for you now, and it'll be ready at the front desk tomorrow. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 288.74,
      "end_seconds": 291.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.5,
      "end_seconds": 297.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Can I go now? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.14,
      "end_seconds": 305.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "You can, Callum. Good luck with the apprenticeship. ~"
    }
  ]
}
